{"id": "EUVD-2026-27624", "enisaUuid": "eb09e9c0-9a80-33cf-a74b-ac2b6e553860", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nxfrm: account XFRMA_IF_ID in aevent size calculation\n\nxfrm_get_ae() allocates the reply skb with xfrm_aevent_msgsize(), then\nbuild_aevent() appends attributes including XFRMA_IF_ID when x->if_id is\nset.\n\nxfrm_aevent_msgsize() does not include space for XFRMA_IF_ID. For states\nwith if_id, build_aevent() can fail with -EMSGSIZE and hit BUG_ON(err < 0)\nin xfrm_get_ae(), turning a malformed netlink interaction into a kernel\npanic.\n\nAccount XFRMA_IF_ID in the size calculation unconditionally and replace\nthe BUG_ON with normal error unwinding.", "datePublished": "2026-05-06T07:40:35", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:40:04", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f8f3bb89ab677db15f9f5250c77af728f9afe995", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2c41283d94af943a05f7f2cc1a01f0c872f3cf43", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e62e322ea20be78e346e4b49f9a6b9f03313af4c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/58e5735d1a5373652f405a0c16e54ac04aaab0ad", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7081d46d32312f1a31f0e0e99c6835a394037599"], "aliases": ["GHSA-v6vr-f94r-r434", "CVE-2026-43107"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "078fb196-1258-3dda-90e5-31cc5dde05a0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "0c31f0e5-c495-32f1-8fbf-d56a2ee4fe29", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7e6526404adedf079279aa7aa11722deaca8fe2e <e62e322ea20be78e346e4b49f9a6b9f03313af4c"}, {"id": "394a999f-9d24-3321-81f0-e5c4992ba16c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.83"}, {"id": "3f90ec12-b736-3533-8870-07a321460f6f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.19.14"}, {"id": "403b859a-c446-3fc9-938c-7097887a4ddd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7e6526404adedf079279aa7aa11722deaca8fe2e <7081d46d32312f1a31f0e0e99c6835a394037599"}, {"id": "a24e9363-f247-3718-8aa1-6ac7af62107f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.24"}, {"id": "a6917356-3f76-30f4-abb3-f7ae584ee6b4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "4.19"}, {"id": "b0d1309a-2ae9-3c40-bb03-f39fe2da4c53", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "bf9120e3-e3fc-3b9f-9275-856178d0a583", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.0"}, {"id": "c5e757c4-ddd8-36fb-a903-95f7be3b0f05", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7e6526404adedf079279aa7aa11722deaca8fe2e <2c41283d94af943a05f7f2cc1a01f0c872f3cf43"}, {"id": "e215f0df-5448-30a7-b981-489aa73195ac", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7e6526404adedf079279aa7aa11722deaca8fe2e <58e5735d1a5373652f405a0c16e54ac04aaab0ad"}, {"id": "e8afe257-4820-3422-aeb9-aa2a3c008206", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7e6526404adedf079279aa7aa11722deaca8fe2e <f8f3bb89ab677db15f9f5250c77af728f9afe995"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a694f93f-7cae-3c5b-aeb1-cdf51049df97", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}